  "title": "Top 7 KPIs Specialty Practice Leaders Should Track When Implementing Ambient AI and RCM Automation",
  "summary": "Tracking the right KPIs is essential to proving the ROI of **ambient AI and RCM automation** in specialty practices like cardiology, orthopedics, and oncology. By monitoring metrics such as denial rates, A/R days, and documentation time, practice leaders can quantify efficiency gains, revenue growth, and provider satisfaction to ensure their investment drives lasting impact.",
